WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:23.627
"Good morning, everyone," Mr. Icky said in Cooking class the next day.

2
00:00:23.628 --> 00:00:26.149
Mr. Freaky stood beside him.

3
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:30.707
"Mr. Freaky has come to tell us some very exciting news."

4
00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:34.194
"Is school ending early today?" a ghoul asked.

5
00:00:34.195 --> 00:00:38.189
The students laughed.

6
00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:41.934
"No more monster math!" a witch shouted.

7
00:00:41.935 --> 00:00:44.570
"Yeah!" others cheered.

8
00:00:44.571 --> 00:00:47.022
Mr. Freaky held up his hands.

9
00:00:47.023 --> 00:00:49.630
"Everyone, please settle down!"

10
00:00:49.631 --> 00:00:56.645
He took out a handkerchief and blew his noses.

11
00:00:56.646 --> 00:01:00.413
"A popular cooking show is coming to our town this Friday.

12
00:01:00.414 --> 00:01:04.420
It's called Kids' Kitchen Showdown."

13
00:01:04.421 --> 00:01:07.367
"Cool!" a fish monster said.

14
00:01:07.368 --> 00:01:11.026
"I love that TV show!" the witch said.

15
00:01:11.027 --> 00:01:16.373
"But I wish the cooks made more good food like tarantula stew.

16
00:01:16.374 --> 00:01:24.683
They usually make food for people, like chocolate cake and something called lasagna."

17
00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:27.020
"Yeah," the ghoul said.

18
00:01:27.021 --> 00:01:30.321
"Why can't they cook more stuff for monsters?"

19
00:01:30.361 --> 00:01:35.974
Ben had watched Kids' Kitchen Showdown once or twice with his mom, but he didn't really like it.

20
00:01:35.975 --> 00:01:39.359
Why would anyone watch a show about cooking?

21
00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.761
Mr. Freaky wrung his hands.

22
00:01:41.762 --> 00:01:45.311
"The show was going to be filmed at People Place Middle School.

23
00:01:45.312 --> 00:01:50.137
But Mayor Hubbletree suggested they film it here at Monster Academy."

24
00:01:50.138 --> 00:01:54.722
"Mayor Hubbletree wants the show to be here?" Mr. Icky said.

25
00:01:54.723 --> 00:01:59.936
Ben saw a bead of sweat roll down Mr. Freaky's face.

26
00:01:59.937 --> 00:02:06.208
"The mayor wants the world to see that monsters and humans can get along," Mr. Freaky replied.

27
00:02:06.209 --> 00:02:08.887
"We can share food and have fun together.

28
00:02:08.888 --> 00:02:13.296
People Place Middle School has already chosen three cooks to compete on the show.

29
00:02:13.297 --> 00:02:18.212
Now it's Mr. Icky's turn to select one cook from Monster Academy."

30
00:02:18.213 --> 00:02:20.865
"Awesome!" a mummy said.

31
00:02:20.866 --> 00:02:24.536
A werewolf howled.

32
00:02:24.537 --> 00:02:27.126
Mr. Freaky turned to Mr. Icky.

33
00:02:27.127 --> 00:02:29.869
"The whole world will be watching this show.

34
00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.044
Nothing can go wrong."

35
00:02:32.045 --> 00:02:41.629
The principal blew his noses again and then left the room.

36
00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:44.614
"Okay, students," Mr. Icky said.

37
00:02:44.615 --> 00:02:46.649
"Let's begin today's assignment.

38
00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:52.154
I want everyone to make their very best batch of tarantula stew."

39
00:02:52.155 --> 00:02:58.789
"This is so exciting," Winnie said to Ben as students started gathering ingredients from the pantry.

40
00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:02.696
"Can you imagine being on Kids' Kitchen Showdown?"

41
00:03:02.697 --> 00:03:06.848
"Yeah," Ben said with a groan.

42
00:03:06.849 --> 00:03:10.006
"I can imagine it as the worst thing in the world."

43
00:03:10.007 --> 00:03:14.625
Winnie laughed. "I know you don't like cooking.

44
00:03:14.626 --> 00:03:16.505
But you're better at it than you think.

45
00:03:16.506 --> 00:03:20.706
And we need people to see that monsters make good food too."

46
00:03:20.707 --> 00:03:24.637
Ben just rolled his eyes and reached for his apron.

47
00:03:24.638 --> 00:03:28.751
Usually tarantula stew contained moldy peaches.

48
00:03:28.752 --> 00:03:34.659
But by the time Ben looked in the pantry, the peaches were all gone.

49
00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:38.184
He saw some rotten nectarines with worms.

50
00:03:38.185 --> 00:03:43.999
"Nectarines are sort of like peaches," Ben thought.

51
00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:48.412
He chopped the nectarines and dumped them into his pot.

52
00:03:48.413 --> 00:03:50.477
He dropped the worms in too.

53
00:03:50.478 --> 00:03:55.273
Then he added some fresh tarantula legs and cinnamon.

54
00:03:55.274 --> 00:04:01.344
As he mixed the sauce, green vapors rose from the surface.

55
00:04:01.345 --> 00:04:03.515
"Oh, boy," Ben thought.

56
00:04:03.516 --> 00:04:07.229
"Tarantula stew isn't supposed to look like this.

57
00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:11.814
I messed up!" He looked around the classroom.

58
00:04:11.815 --> 00:04:15.037
Everyone was busy working.

59
00:04:15.038 --> 00:04:16.941
Ben looked into his pot again.

60
00:04:16.942 --> 00:04:18.841
"Ack!" he cried.

61
00:04:18.842 --> 00:04:21.879
His stew was starting to burn at the edges.

62
00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:26.398
He scraped the sides of his pot, mixing the burned edges into the stew.

63
00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:29.935
The stew took on a darker color now.

64
00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:34.466
Ben sighed. "It's ruined."

65
00:04:34.467 --> 00:04:38.291
He turned off the burner on his stove and lifted the pot.

66
00:04:38.292 --> 00:04:40.571
He floated toward the garbage can.

67
00:04:40.572 --> 00:04:44.215
Mr. Icky blocked his path, looking stern.

68
00:04:44.216 --> 00:04:47.276
"You are not going to throw that out!"

69
00:04:47.277 --> 00:04:52.997
The teacher took the pot from Ben and brought it back to Ben's workspace.

70
00:04:52.998 --> 00:04:58.596
"I've watched you do that every day for the past two weeks," Mr. Icky said.

71
00:04:58.597 --> 00:05:04.418
"No more! If you throw out your food every time you mess up, you'll never improve.

72
00:05:04.419 --> 00:05:07.472
You must taste your mistakes!"

73
00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:11.723
Mr. Icky shoved a spoon toward Ben. "Taste it!"

74
00:05:11.724 --> 00:05:14.858
Ben wrinkled his nose.

75
00:05:14.859 --> 00:05:24.157
Then he dipped the spoon into the stew and tasted it.

76
00:05:24.158 --> 00:05:27.816
"I guess it's not that bad."

77
00:05:27.817 --> 00:05:30.398
"Good," Mr. Icky said.

78
00:05:30.399 --> 00:05:37.380
The teacher lifted the spoon to his lips. Suddenly he gasped.

79
00:05:37.381 --> 00:05:42.426
"Uh-oh." Ben froze. "It's even worse than I thought."

80
00:05:42.427 --> 00:05:45.170
Mr. Icky swallowed.

81
00:05:45.171 --> 00:05:46.813
He looked at the stew.

82
00:05:46.814 --> 00:05:49.549
Then he looked at Ben.

83
00:05:49.550 --> 00:05:55.512
"You used rotten nectarines, didn't you? And do I taste worms?"

84
00:05:55.513 --> 00:05:59.514
Ben winced. "Um, I guess so."

85
00:05:59.515 --> 00:06:03.560
Mr. Icky took another taste and closed his eyes.

86
00:06:03.561 --> 00:06:09.873
"This reminds me of a tarantula stew I had in Paris many years ago.

87
00:06:09.874 --> 00:06:14.241
Monster chefs in France always use rotten nectarines.

88
00:06:14.242 --> 00:06:20.760
Ben, you are not just a cook—you are a true chef!"

89
00:06:20.761 --> 00:06:23.321
"Wh-what?" Ben stammered.

90
00:06:23.322 --> 00:06:26.073
"That's ridiculous. I don't even know how to—"

91
00:06:26.074 --> 00:06:29.295
"You have a gift, Ben," Mr. Icky said.

92
00:06:29.296 --> 00:06:39.583
"That's why I'm going to choose you to compete on Kids' Kitchen Showdown this Friday!"
